# Entire eval folder — scripts, datasets, and outputs alike. These are
# generated evaluation artifacts rebuilt from the query log on demand, not
# source, and they churn constantly. Datasets here also embed large amounts of
# corpus text (the sample/fictitious contract set), which makes for noisy diffs
# and pointless repo weight. Blocking the folder rather than chasing filename
# patterns, after a suffixed variant ("eval_dataset 998.jsonl") slipped past an
# earlier exact-name rule.
app/eval/

